    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERSACT, NO. 3 OF 2016",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      273.65,
      401.9,
      298.07
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      312.89,
      401.95,
      337.31
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the National Minimum Wageof Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      352.25,
      401.94,
      455.27
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of WorkersAct, No. 3 of 2016 is hereby amended in subsection (1)thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201ctwelve thousandfive hundred rupees and the national minimum daily wageof a worker shall be five hundred rupees\u201d, of the words\u201cseventeen thousand five hundred rupees and the nationalminimum daily wage of a worker shall be seven hundredrupees\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      469.25,
      401.89,
      494.15
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
